        {
          "title": "‘KUNG FUN PANOORIN SA KANILA, FUN DIN SIYANG GAWIN FOR ME’\n\nContent creator and comedian Charlize Ruth Reyes, also known as Charuth, looked back on her experience joining “LOL: Last One Laughing Philippines” Season 2.\n\n“Ang saya kasi nung pumasok ako, ic-claim ko na, na kahit papaano ni-represent ko ’yung mga fellow content creators ko kasi galing naman akong online,” she said.\n\nShe also shared how much she enjoys portraying different characters, saying it is just as fun for her to perform them as it is for audiences to watch.\n\nCharuth finished as the runner-up in the comedy competition, with Candy Pangilinan and Donna Cariaga sharing the Season 2 win.\n\nShe also teased more comedy projects with Pencilbox Comedy, telling fans to watch out for their upcoming work. (Video by Janelle Lorzano/The Philippine STAR)",
